<Layout title="PantryPal">

<h1>PantryPal</h1>

<h2>Android App - Food Item Barcode Scanner</h2>

<p>
PantryPal is an android app which assists in keeping track of food in a hoousehold kitchen.
Using either the built-in camera or a bluetooth enabled barcode scanner, PantryPal scans
the barcode of an item and provides the operator with its product definition. Extra functionality
is provided to monitor expiration dates, which contributes to the auto generation of shopping
lists. Other contributing parameters are low-stock and out-of-stock markers.
</p>

